blurb: The South Portland Board of Education held a budget workshop for the Superintendent’sFY25Budget,
  featuring detailed presentations from the Special Education, Adult Education, Athletics,
  Technology, and Operations & Safety departments. A significant discussion also took
  place regarding the future of the Extended Learning Opportunities (ELO) program,
  with the administration committing to its continuation despite funding challenges.
